{"overview":"هر تابستان، بلی و خانواده‌اش به خانه ساحلی فیشرها در کاوزینز می‌روند. هر تابستان یکسان است... تا وقتی بلی شانزده ساله می‌شود. روابط به آزمون می‌افتند، حقایق دردناک فاش می‌شوند و بلی برای همیشه تغییر می‌کند. این تابستان اولین عشق، اولین دل‌شکستگی و بزرگ‌ شدن است — تابستانی که او زیبا می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Every summer, Belly and her family head to the Fishers’ beach house in Cousins. Every summer is the same ... until Belly turns sixteen. Relationships will be tested, painful truths will be revealed, and Belly will be forever changed. It’s a summer of first love, first heartbreak and growing up — it's the summer she turns pretty.","tagline_en":"We'll always have summer.","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":7,"y":2022,"poster":"/6yCL5HB1ugO3bMwloEDNiNdadUa.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":8,"y":2023,"poster":"/A7ziP4QaTRAwWqGhHyknN5UULlf.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":11,"y":2025,"poster":"/9j1Z6Scp0pia1yQEsDeEnx3N5l7.jpg"}],"episodes":26,"crew":["جنی هان","Gabrielle Stanton"],"crew_en":["Jenny Han","Gabrielle Stanton"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"لولا تانگ","role":"Isabel 'Belly' Conklin","photo":"/gnkrdZniagAbZQcYSoYcADKOQMg.jpg","en":"Lola Tung"},{"name":"Christopher Briney","role":"Conrad Fisher","photo":"/1M21pqg3Lf8n6gwI9l9RX1PuPjw.jpg"},{"name":"گوین کاسالگنو","role":"Jeremiah Fisher","photo":"/snYCYm31OniXr024HUcomunYpjV.jpg","en":"Gavin Casalegno"},{"name":"Sean Kaufman","role":"Steven Conklin","photo":"/9sMkCOJU6tWIoezXBapA58C4qpH.jpg"},{"name":"Rain Spencer","role":"Taylor Jewel","photo":"/1gb8I7otyQAfCGnAOgnN7vnRaHj.jpg"},{"name":"Jackie Chung","role":"Laurel Park","photo":"/ag7jjCLKVRJg9o1JdldsvFCMawR.jpg"},{"name":"Isabella Briggs","role":"Denise","photo":"/7oIGzfJloE9cXXSkyyStgXzVCaP.jpg"},{"name":"Kristen Connolly","role":"Lucinda Jewel","photo":"/zcI32zxpotOTOYetH0PL7ZoHl6E.jpg"}],"trailer":"faL_S-7z4_I","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/194766-the-summer-i-turn